-- statement:
--   For every real p in [123/4,31], coarse-box original norm data with singleton norm sum three, total norm below 591/500, and pair-gap sum below 2/((443/1000)p) imply the explicit norm cap and linear bounds of analytic domain 1. This block covers 4 consecutive certified slabs. Unequal singleton norms are allowed.
